`benchmark.meta description: Repeated scalar Map deletion and reinsertion at 80,000 entries.
`benchmark.meta timing: recommended
`benchmark.meta profiles: compile-timing

/core

. count = 80000 as Size
. checksum = 0u64
for repetition in 0 .. < 5
    . map = Map'U64'U64()
    for index in 0 .. < count
        map[index as U64] = index as U64
    for index in 0 .. < count
        -= map[index as U64]
    checksum += map.length as U64

-- "bench-result map/remove-uniform-scalar-80000 checksum=$checksum"
